Mocka is a desktop built from scratch for GhostBSD. It replaces MATE
one component at a time, staying compatible with MATE along the way,
and is built for FreeBSD and GhostBSD with no Linux-specific
assumptions.

This metaport installs the Mocka components, such as Mocka Dock, on
top of the MATE desktop they replace, along with extra applications
and the GhostBSD settings, themes, fonts and wallpapers.
